      "prompt": "The iterative formula x_(n+1) = (22 - x_n^2) / 7 is used with x_0 = 3. Find the values of x_1, x_2 and x_3, giving each answer to 3 decimal places.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Iterative formula: x_(n+1) = (22 - x_n^2) / 7",
        "x_0 = 3",
        "x_1 = g(x_0) = (22 - 3^2) / 7 = 1.857",
        "x_2 = g(x_1) = (22 - 1.857^2) / 7 = 2.650",
        "x_3 = g(x_2) = (22 - 2.650^2) / 7 = 2.140"
      ],
      "final_answer": "x_1 = 1.857, x_2 = 2.650, x_3 = 2.140",
      "marks": 5,
