      "topic_id": "angles_polygon_interior",
      "prompt": "A polygon has 6 sides. 5 of its interior angles are each 123°, and the remaining interior angle is (3x + 54)°. Find x.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Sum of interior angles = (n - 2) × 180 = (6 - 2) × 180 = 720°",
        "Sum of the 5 equal angles = 5 × 123 = 615°",
        "Remaining angle = 720 - 615 = 105°",
